# Sea of Spores Fever (Q102): an elven mystic of level 12 accepts at Alberius, takes his letter
# to Cobendell, kills ten dryads for their tears (every roll pinned to succeed), brings
# Cobendell's medicines back, hands one to each of the four sick guards and returns to
# Alberius, who gives a mystic the Staff of Sentinel, spiritshots and the echo crystals; then
# relog. Expectations replay the reference trace of this scenario.
